  "reviewProtocol": {
    "raw": "Keep immutable model judge output, result/usage/source hashes and grade. Never overwrite it with reviewer judgment.",
    "packet": "Show only original/target/context and learner-visible feedback or unavailability. Exclude model,phase,raw grades,expected grades,provider IDs and internal notes. Random opaque IDs and hash-sort hide source order. Wording can still reveal implementation.",
    "review": "Record a separate grade with evidenceHash,reviewer identity/exposure and reason codes. This session can perform only same-author partially blinded review; it cannot certify independence.",
    "adjudication": "Bind a third record to the review hash. Explicitly confirm raw,confirm review or keep unresolved. Unresolved/missing/stale review holds the final verdict; no silent grade replacement.",
    "referenceChange": "If a witness/reference is disputed, retain original raw grades and halt calibration acceptance. Revise/reference-review before a newly approved collection; do not tune references to improve an observed judge score.",
    "independence": "Actual qualification/consent and independent learner review remain T37. Three AI judges or partial blinding cannot replace it."
  },
